# Root-context .dockerignore for api/Dockerfile (Docker Context Path = repo
# root — needed so db/migrations/ can be COPY'd into the API image).
#
# ALLOWLIST shape: ignore everything, then re-include exactly the paths the
# Dockerfile COPYs. Anything new must be re-included here explicitly — a new
# secret or junk file can never leak into the build context by default.
# (NOTE: api/.dockerignore does NOT apply to root-context builds — Docker only
# reads the context root's .dockerignore. web/Dockerfile keeps its own web/
# context and is unaffected by this file.)
*
!api/package.json
!api/bun.lock
!api/bunfig.toml
!api/tsconfig.json
!api/src
!api/scripts/migrate.ts
!db/migrations
# Never ship tests, even though they live under the re-included api/src:
api/src/**/*.test.ts
